Dear Mr. Jaymin Bhavsar,

I hope this email finds you well.

I am writing to follow up on the documents required to proceed with the Wat=
er Audit Report for
Troikaa Pharmaceuticals Ltd.

To ensure a smooth and timely process, especially as your validity date of =
 is
approaching, we kindly request you to provide the following documents:

=95 1) Name & Designation of the Team Member involved in the audit
=95 2) Annual Production for Apr 2024 - Mar 2025 and Apr 2025 - Mar 2026
=95 3) Details of Utilities installed in the industry (Serial Number, Type =
of Utility, Make, Capacity, Year of Installation, Efficiency of the utility=
)
=95 4) Shift-wise details of Employees employed in the industry (Shift Deta=
ils, Permanent Workers, Contractual Workers)
=95 5) Details of Township & number of people/workers residing
=95 6) Details of Bore well (Depth, Diameter, Year of Construction, Water L=
evel, Hp of pump installed, Flow Meter details, Telemetry Details)
=95 7) Details of Piezometers (Type of Piezometer, Make of Piezometer, Dept=
h of Piezometer installed, Depth of piezometer constructed, Water level of =
piezometer, Diameter of piezometer, Details of Telemetry)
=95 8) Water data (Monthly Fresh water consumption, Utility wise water cons=
umption, Recycled data, Waste water generation) for Apr 2024 - Mar 2025 and=
 Apr 2025 - Mar 2026
=95 9) Assessment of performance of utility (Approximate efficiency)
=95 10) Ground Water Quality Analysis Report =96 Latest
=95 11) Waste Water Quality Analysis Report =96 Latest (ETP and STP)
=95 12) Water Balance Diagram as per CGWA NOC in word file
=95 13) Description of Effluent Treatment Plant
=95 14) Description of Sewage Treatment Plant
=95 15) Cost of domestic waste water treatment (As per the format mentioned=
 in the checklist)
=95 16) Cost of Industrial waste water treatment (As per the format mention=
ed in the checklist)

Your timely cooperation is essential for us to complete the necessary repor=
ts and renewals
without any delays.

The validity date is approaching on , so your prompt submission would be
greatly appreciated.

If you have any questions or need any clarification, please don't hesitate =
to get in touch.
Thank you for your attention to this matter.

Best regards,
Mitul Jain

